---
---

<section class="amp-section amp-features" id="hosting" data-local-content>
	<div class="amp-wrap">
		<!-- Feature 1: Run anywhere -->
		<article class="feature-row" data-reveal>
			<div class="feature-copy">
				<p class="amp-eyebrow">Run anywhere</p>
				<h2>Start on one machine.<br />Keep the architecture.</h2>
				<p>Small single-node installations and larger distributed fleets use the exact same sharded topology. Scaling out changes shard placements and replicas—not your application code or data model.</p>
				<ul class="feature-points">
					<li>Zero architectural rewrites when moving from local dev to production</li>
					<li>Physical SQLite shards mapped via deterministic virtual hash ranges</li>
					<li>Plug in RocksDB, LMDB, or libSQL with identical query semantics</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="feature-visual servers-visual">
				<div class="server-rack">
					<div class="server-node node-1">
						<div class="node-lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
						<div class="node-meta">
							<span>Node 01 (Primary)</span>
							<code>fra1 · 4 shards</code>
						</div>
						<div class="node-bar"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 45%"></div></div>
					</div>
					<div class="server-node node-2">
						<div class="node-lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
						<div class="node-meta">
							<span>Node 02 (Worker)</span>
							<code>ams1 · 2 replicas</code>
						</div>
						<div class="node-bar"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 68%"></div></div>
					</div>
					<div class="server-node node-3">
						<div class="node-lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
						<div class="node-meta">
							<span>Node 03 (Worker)</span>
							<code>lhr1 · 2 replicas</code>
						</div>
						<div class="node-bar"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 52%"></div></div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="cluster-badge">
					<svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10" />
					</svg>
					<span>One Logical App Platform</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>

		<!-- Feature 2: Explicit authority -->
		<article class="feature-row reverse" data-reveal>
			<div class="feature-copy">
				<p class="amp-eyebrow">Explicit authority</p>
				<h2>A child knows its parent.<br />It never becomes it.</h2>
				<p>Customer projects receive scoped runtime envelopes and services while the Platform Fabric retains node, placement, generation, and fleet authority. No child process can escalate privileges or compromise other tenants.</p>
				<ul class="feature-points">
					<li>Control plane and data plane never share a single failure domain</li>
					<li>Generation leases prevent split-brain writes during node failover</li>
					<li>Gateway-enforced authentication with zero implicit default projects</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="feature-visual authority-visual">
				<div class="authority-box">
					<div class="authority-root">
						<span class="auth-shield">🛡</span>
						<div>
							<b>Platform Fabric Authority</b>
							<small>Node Leases · Generation Fencing · Schedulers</small>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="authority-flow-lines">
						<span></span><span></span><span></span>
					</div>
					<div class="authority-children">
						<div class="child-envelope">
							<b>Project Alpha</b>
							<span>Scoped Envelope</span>
						</div>
						<div class="child-envelope">
							<b>Project Beta</b>
							<span>Scoped Envelope</span>
						</div>
						<div class="child-envelope">
							<b>Project Gamma</b>
							<span>Scoped Envelope</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>

		<!-- Feature 3: Extensible by design -->
		<article class="feature-row" data-reveal>
			<div class="feature-copy">
				<p class="amp-eyebrow">Extensible by design</p>
				<h2>Plugins contribute.<br />Contracts decide.</h2>
				<p>Third-party and community packages extend validated, namespaced capabilities. Trusted core services define the schemas and privileged boundaries, preventing unauthorized runtime side-effects.</p>
				<ul class="feature-points">
					<li>Typed capability discovery (`zelavis/identity:*`, `zelavis/storage:*`)</li>
					<li>Zero magic monkey-patching or hidden global state mutations</li>
					<li>First-class package ecosystem installable via standard npm</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="feature-visual plugins-visual">
				<div class="plugins-core">
					<div class="core-tag">Core Registry</div>
					<b>zelavis/core</b>
					<code>Typed Capability Broker</code>
				</div>
				<div class="plugins-grid">
					<div class="plugin-card">
						<span class="plug-icon">🔑</span>
						<b>auth</b>
						<small>OAuth &amp; WebAuthn</small>
					</div>
					<div class="plugin-card">
						<span class="plug-icon">💳</span>
						<b>payments</b>
						<small>Stripe &amp; Webhooks</small>
					</div>
					<div class="plugin-card">
						<span class="plug-icon">📦</span>
						<b>storage</b>
						<small>S3 &amp; Local Disk</small>
					</div>
					<div class="plugin-card">
						<span class="plug-icon">🌐</span>
						<b>frontend</b>
						<small>Astro &amp; Static</small>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.amp-features {
		padding: 60px 0 120px;
	}

	.amp-wrap {
		width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 64px));
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 120px;
	}

	.feature-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 80px;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.feature-row.reverse .feature-copy {
		order: 2;
	}

	.feature-row.reverse .feature-visual {
		order: 1;
	}

	.amp-eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 14px;
		font-size: 13px;
		line-height: 1.2;
		font-weight: 750;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #5846cf;
	}

	.feature-copy h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 54px);
		line-height: 1.1;
		letter-spacing: -0.035em;
		font-weight: 750;
		color: #121422;
	}

	.feature-copy > p {
		margin: 20px 0 24px;
		font-size: 16.5px;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: #616576;
	}

	.feature-points {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 10px;
	}

	.feature-points li {
		position: relative;
		padding-left: 22px;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: #3b3e4f;
		font-weight: 500;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.feature-points li::before {
		content: "✓";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 0;
		color: #5846cf;
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	/* Visual Containers */
	.feature-visual {
		min-height: 380px;
		border-radius: 24px;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 40px;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	/* Feature 1: Servers Visual */
	.servers-visual {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef2ff, #f3f5fe);
		border: 1px solid #dce2f9;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 20px;
	}

	.server-rack {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 360px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 10px;
	}

	.server-node {
		padding: 14px 16px;
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid #e2e6f4;
		box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(30, 35, 75, 0.05);
	}

	.node-lights {
		display: flex;
		gap: 5px;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}

	.node-lights i {
		width: 6px;
		height: 6px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #3bb26c;
	}

	.node-lights i:nth-child(2) { background: #5a49d4; }
	.node-lights i:nth-child(3) { background: #ffaa5b; }

	.node-meta {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #1a1c29;
	}

	.node-meta code {
		font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
		font-size: 10.5px;
		color: #727689;
	}

	.node-bar {
		margin-top: 10px;
		height: 5px;
		border-radius: 3px;
		background: #eef1f8;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.bar-fill {
		height: 100%;
		border-radius: 3px;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, #5846cf, #7766f0);
	}

	.cluster-badge {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
		padding: 6px 14px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid #d9dff4;
		font-size: 11px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #4b3ec2;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(40, 30, 100, 0.06);
	}

	/* Feature 2: Authority Visual */
	.authority-visual {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6f0ff, #f9f5ff);
		border: 1px solid #e7dcfa;
	}

	.authority-box {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 380px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.authority-root {
		width: 100%;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
		padding: 16px 20px;
		border-radius: 14px;
		background: #231c3d;
		color: #fff;
		box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(35, 28, 61, 0.2);
	}

	.auth-shield {
		font-size: 24px;
	}

	.authority-root b {
		display: block;
		font-size: 14px;
	}

	.authority-root small {
		display: block;
		font-size: 10px;
		color: #b7addd;
		margin-top: 2px;
	}

	.authority-flow-lines {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-around;
		width: 80%;
	}

	.authority-flow-lines span {
		width: 2px;
		height: 24px;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8162e8, #c6b4f7);
	}

	.authority-children {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 8px;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.child-envelope {
		padding: 12px 8px;
		border-radius: 10px;
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid #e5dbf7;
		text-align: center;
		box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(45, 30, 85, 0.05);
	}

	.child-envelope b {
		display: block;
		font-size: 11.5px;
		color: #1f1b2b;
	}

	.child-envelope span {
		display: block;
		font-size: 9px;
		color: #6952b8;
		margin-top: 3px;
	}

	/* Feature 3: Plugins Visual */
	.plugins-visual {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0ed, #fff6f4);
		border: 1px solid #fce0da;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 18px;
	}

	.plugins-core {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 360px;
		padding: 16px 20px;
		border-radius: 14px;
		background: #251e22;
		color: #fff;
		text-align: center;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(40, 25, 30, 0.15);
	}

	.core-tag {
		font-size: 9.5px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #ff9885;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		margin-bottom: 2px;
	}

	.plugins-core b {
		display: block;
		font-size: 15px;
	}

	.plugins-core code {
		display: block;
		font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
		font-size: 10px;
		color: #b7a9ad;
		margin-top: 3px;
	}

	.plugins-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 10px;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 360px;
	}

	.plugin-card {
		padding: 14px 12px;
		border-radius: 10px;
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid #fae0da;
		text-align: center;
		box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(60, 25, 30, 0.04);
	}

	.plug-icon {
		display: block;
		font-size: 18px;
		margin-bottom: 4px;
	}

	.plugin-card b {
		display: block;
		font-size: 12px;
		color: #211c1d;
	}

	.plugin-card small {
		display: block;
		font-size: 9.5px;
		color: #8c7b7f;
	}

	@media (max-width: 960px) {
		.feature-row {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 48px;
		}

		.feature-row.reverse .feature-copy {
			order: 1;
		}

		.feature-row.reverse .feature-visual {
			order: 2;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.amp-features {
			padding: 40px 0 80px;
		}

		.amp-wrap {
			gap: 80px;
		}

		.feature-visual {
			padding: 24px 16px;
			min-height: 320px;
		}

		.authority-children {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
